                            <!-- OC Layout Element Conent Template -->
							              <!--normalTemplateStart--><div class="grid">
    <div class="col-xs-12">
        <h1 class='oc-page-title '>Election Data and Maps</h1>
        
        <p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><iframe title="Public_PBI_At_a_Glance_Dashboard_2026_General_Election" width="1000" height="500" src="https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiNTBhZGQxMzMtMDkxYS00MWU1LTljYjAtODYxMjY4NDA5ZGUyIiwidCI6IjM5Yzg3YWIzLTY2MTItNDJjMC05NjIwLWE2OTZkMTJkZjgwMyJ9" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="true"></iframe></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">The top number (SCORE) reflects voters credited with voting; the bottom number reflects ballots physically counted by our tabulation system. These are independent systems and small discrepancies are normal during processing. Audits continue and errors are corrected until Certification and Canvass on Nov. 24.</p>
<div data-layout="3" data-title-level="3" class="featured-links featured-links-option-3">
<div class="featured-links-body clearfix">
<ul class="clearfix">
<li><a class="featured-link" href="https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/ssharp8813/viz/DenverInteractiveRegistrationData/Welcome" target="_blank">Voter Registration Data</a></li>
<li><a class="featured-link" href="https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiNTBhZGQxMzMtMDkxYS00MWU1LTljYjAtODYxMjY4NDA5ZGUyIiwidCI6IjM5Yzg3YWIzLTY2MTItNDJjMC05NjIwLWE2OTZkMTJkZjgwMyJ9" target="_blank">Current Ballot Returns Data</a></li>
<li><a class="featured-link" href="https://denvergov.org/electionresults#/results/20260630" target="_blank">Nov. 3 General Election Results</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div data-type="0" data-title-level="2" class="oc-wysiwyg-container">
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel">
<h2>Ballot Return Data and Election Results</h2>
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel-content">
<p><a href="https://www.denvergov.org/Government/Agencies-Departments-Offices/Agencies-Departments-Offices-Directory/Denver-Clerk-and-Recorder/Elections-Division/Election-Data-and-Maps/Results-Archive" target="_blank">Search for official election results</a>&nbsp;and download historical voter registration and turnout data. Results are also available by precinct.</p>
<hr />
